## 6. Regulatory notice

This application is a bookkeeping tool intended to help Vietnamese household
businesses (hộ kinh doanh / cá nhân kinh doanh) meet the record-keeping, invoicing
and tax-reporting requirements of the Ministry of Finance's **Circular 152** (Thông tư
152), including the household accounting template set (bộ mẫu Excel HKD) and the
periodic VAT and personal income tax declarations.

It is an independent tool. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or a substitute for
any decision of the Ministry of Finance, the General Department of Taxation, or any
e-invoice service provider, and it makes no guarantee that any particular business is
compliant. Users remain responsible for the accuracy of their records and for
compliance with applicable Vietnamese law and tax deadlines.

